Dedicated Emulation Console

Project Overview
A low-power, dedicated hardware emulation running Linux Mint.

Hardware Stack
1. SBC: Raspberry Pi 5 (4GB)
2. Cooling: Active Cooler
3. OS: Linux Mint / Batocera 

Software Setup
1. Flashes base Linux Mint / Batocera OS image to storage.
2. Executes `firmware/setup.sh` to configure system packages and dependencies.
3. Sets up display scaling and auto-start configurations.
